   "en": "Touhou - MEAT MATE MEET (Doujinshi)"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "Human meat is back on the menu, and mass-produced this time. However, the youkai seem to be displeased with the bad taste of the food they enjoy so much. This dissatisfaction has reached the ears of a group that aims to improve the rationed food. At the same time, there is a new group that plans to release the humans used as ingredients."
